    `o 18 r 3(2)(a)(iii) ordered that costs be reserved`
    `o 18 r 3(2)(a)(iv) decided that there is to be no order as to costs or that each party is to bear its own costs`
    `o 18 r 3(2)(a) done something else on costs`

