      `a request is made for the Court (not including the Registrar) to hear further arguments in respect of a decision on a matter` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the date the Court affirmed, varied or set aside the decision after hearing further arguments` IS A MAYBE DATE
      `the date the Court certified, or is deemed to have certified, that no further arguments are required` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`o 18 r 3(2)(d) the date after which the time runs for the appeal or the application for permission against the decisions on all matters` MEANS
    IF `it is a single application pending trial dealing with more than one matter` AND `a request is made for the Court (not including the Registrar) to hear further arguments in respect of a decision on a matter`
    THEN
        CONSIDER `the date the Court affirmed, varied or set aside the decision after hearing further arguments`
        WHEN JUST affirmed THEN JUST affirmed
        WHEN NOTHING THEN `the date the Court certified, or is deemed to have certified, that no further arguments are required`
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "in the case of a single application pending trial dealing with more than one matter, where a request is made for the Court (not including the Registrar) to hear further arguments" (a date cannot be a JUST FALSE; the yes/no functions below carry the "where" that is not met)

@ref O 18 r 3(2)(d) (src:1750-1754)
GIVEN `it is a single application pending trial dealing with more than one matter` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a request is made for the Court (not including the Registrar) to hear further arguments in respect of a decision on a matter` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 18 r 3(2)(d) the time for the appeal or the application for permission against the decisions on all matters runs from the Court's ruling on further arguments` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `it is a single application pending trial dealing with more than one matter` AND `a request is made for the Court (not including the Registrar) to hear further arguments in respect of a decision on a matter` THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "in the case of a single application pending trial dealing with more than one matter, where a request is made for the Court (not including the Registrar) to hear further arguments" (a "where" that is not met, ruling of 2026-11-05 (b))

@ref O 18 r 3(2)(d) (src:1750-1754)
GIVEN `it is a single application pending trial dealing with more than one matter` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a request is made for the Court (not including the Registrar) to hear further arguments in respect of a decision on a matter` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Court has affirmed, varied or set aside the decision after hearing further arguments` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Court has certified, or is deemed to have certified, that no further arguments are required` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 18 r 3(2)(d) the time for the appeal or the application for permission against the decisions on all matters is still barred from running` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (NOT `it is a single application pending trial dealing with more than one matter`) OR (NOT `a request is made for the Court (not including the Registrar) to hear further arguments in respect of a decision on a matter`) THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "in the case of a single application pending trial dealing with more than one matter, where a request is made for the Court (not including the Registrar) to hear further arguments" (a "where" that is not met, ruling of 2026-11-05 (b))
        IF `the Court has affirmed, varied or set aside the decision after hearing further arguments` OR `the Court has certified, or is deemed to have certified, that no further arguments are required` THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "does not begin to run until that Court" (the bar has lifted (ruling of 2026-11-05, delegated (d)))
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE --(the bar holds)

